{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to get <i>Higher Than Mush</i>, a stimulating, yet deeply chill<strong>,</strong> action roguelite platformer where every jump, dash, and decision counts! Dive into procedurally generated psychedelic worlds, built with stunning ray-traced visuals  and push your reflexes to the limit as you collect dopamine to ascend to Nirvana...or overdose trying!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychedelic Visual Feast:</strong> Immerse yourself in breathtaking, ray-traced environments, brought to life with the power of Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/Graphic_settings.gif?t=1743809294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Experience Chaos Destruction!\u00a0</strong>Everything you see can be shattered, crumbled, and blown to bits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/Destruction.gif?t=1743809294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skill-Based Gameplay: Burn for Power, or Play It Safe?</strong> The brighter the Mush, the closer you are to overdosing, but the more powerful your dashes become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/Dash_gif.gif?t=1743809294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedurally Generated Levels: Endless Variety, Unpredictable Difficulty!</strong> Experience challenges that range from surprisingly forgiving to incredibly tough, with a unique level layout every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/Randomm_gif.gif?t=1743809294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Prove Your Dominance: Are You the Ultimate &quot;Mush&quot; Master?</strong> Challenge players worldwide and climb to the top of the leaderboards!... or die trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/extras/Dying_gif.gif?t=1743809294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3558350?t=1743809294","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/0d5d7b005bff6194c2b17decd9c58b79019e1e41/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743809294","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/b4e925e1505a58ccd58c8b7827149b9382221ef9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743809294","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3558350/b4e925e1505a58ccd58c8b7827149b9382221ef9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743809294","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to get <i>Higher Than Mush</i>, a stimulating, yet deeply chill<strong>,</strong> action roguelite platformer where every jump, dash, and decision counts! Dive into procedurally generated psychedelic worlds, built with stunning ray-traced visuals  and push your reflexes to the limit as you collect dopamine to ascend to Nirvana...or overdose trying!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychedelic Visual Feast:</strong> Immerse yourself in breathtaking, ray-traced environments, brought to life with the 